  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 cups milk",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "2 eggs",
    "4 teaspoons baking powder",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "5 tablespoons milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the white cake layer: Mix 3 cups flour, milk, white sugar, eggs, baking powder, 2 teaspoons vanilla extract, and salt together in a large bowl until well-combined. Stir in 1/4 cup melted butter. Pour batter into the prepared baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mb7LYGOWYHuxlquSaMS2_RNGpak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-247073-CinnabonCinnamonRollCake-Step-1-0169-9983e8a0638a4835a20b3b7a3c1b62b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247073/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cinnamon layer: Beat 1 cup softened butter, brown sugar, 2 tablespoons flour, and cinnamon together in a large bowl until smooth. Drop by spoonfuls over the batter in the baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DFU7DQcwbIRpiUM28MFaQnadY5c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-247073-CinnabonCinnamonRollCake-Step-2-0170-a253a7aed53441fbb65bbfd031e54899.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247073/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swirl the top layer into the bottom layer with a knife to create a marble effect.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out nearly clean, 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the glaze: Mix confectioners' sugar, milk, and 1 teaspoon vanilla extract in a large bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iwf4-aysCUjtjvT5UVyD_fjRlCA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-247073-CinnabonCinnamonRollCake-Step-4-0191-026a64461585433483303b4d80af53ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247073/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle glaze over warm cinnamon roll cake. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rNCitt9FfjRbuh4kxAWem1MtyH0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-247073-CinnabonCinnamonRollCake-0195-4x3-a83fe4a4a1e74799b3044e8177266d3c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247073/step_07.webp"
    }
